      ⍝ Bugs37 #20: 2 ⎕JSON of a scalar character
      ⍝





      S37←38 ⎕CR 0 ⋄ S37.y.z←'t'





      2 ⎕JSON S37
{ "y":   { "z": "t" } }




      2 ⎕JSON 'a'
"a"




      2 ⎕JSON 'a' 'bc' 5
[ "a", "bc", 5 ]




      )ERASE S37





      ⍝ Bugs37 #21: inverse 1 ⎕TF / 2 ⎕TF of a function that ⎕FX refuses
